        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 970, Hudson Bay Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPart of Omnia's Traditions Collection, the Hudson Bay Knobset features a simple elegance that makes it alluring. Made out of solid brass, this  Hudson Bay Knob will look great in any home and since it is available in 7 beautiful finishes, you'll be sure to find the right one to fit your tastes. Designed to be easy to install, the Omnia 970 Hudson Bay Knob will cover most 2-1/8 inch pre-drill bore holes and is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Half Round Hudson Bay Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 970 Hudson Bay Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-brass-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
